Regional Depth: Do you want more on Luminara’s political factions? The Crystal Verge’s indigenous clans?

Absolutely—I’d love to flesh both of those out. We can tackle them one at a time or dive into both in parallel. Which would you prefer to start with?

Luminara’s political factions
• Key power blocs, noble houses, merchant guild alliances, revolutionary movements
